sequenceDiagram
    participant G as Gradle
    participant D as Docker
    participant C as Cucumber (@BeforeAll)
    participant S as BlackboxStack
    G->>D: :dockerImage, docker build -t quotes:blackbox
    G->>C: run :blackbox:test
    C->>S: start()
    S->>D: compose up (postgres, wiremock, app)
    D-->>S: all healthchecks green
    S-->>C: baseUrl, wiremockUrl, jdbcUrl (mapped ports)
    loop each scenario
      C->>C: reset stubs, new customerId
      C->>D: HTTP calls, SQL reads
    end
    C->>S: JVM exits, shutdown hook
    S->>D: compose down -v
